@Users_HostAddress = http://localhost:5096

### Get Encryption Key
GET {{Users_HostAddress}}/api/auth/encryption-key
Accept: application/json

###

### Register New User (with encrypted password)
### First obtain the public key from the encryption-key endpoint
### Then encrypt your password using the RSA public key
POST {{Users_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "encryptedPassword": "base64-encrypted-password-here"
}

###

### Login with Email and Password
POST {{Users_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Get Current User (requires access token)
GET {{Users_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {accessToken}

###

### Validate Token
POST {{Users_HostAddress}}/api/auth/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{accessToken}"
}

###

### Refresh Token
POST {{Users_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{refreshToken}"
}

###

### Logout
POST {{Users_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {accessToken}
